      "writtenOn": "2023-01-18T23:43:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This does not look as a good style. If we intend to move from `config`, we should use an rvalue reference here (`\u0026\u0026`), and `std::move` at the call location. Otherwise the caller is unaware that we render its `config` to an unusable state by moving from it.",
      "range": {
